      "body": "### Project URL\n\nhttps://github.com/taskade/mcp\n\n### Category\n\nJS\n\n### Project Title\n\nOfficial MCP server for the Taskade workspace\n\n### Project Description\n\nMIT-licensed MCP server that connects Claude, Cursor, VS Code, or any MCP client to a Taskade workspace. Install locally with `npx -y @taskade/mcp-server`, or use the hosted OAuth 2.0 PKCE endpoint at https://www.taskade.com/mcp. Also includes OpenAPI-to-MCP codegen.\n\n### Highlights\n\n- Official Taskade implementation (not a third-party wrapper)\n- Local stdio install via npm, plus a hosted remote MCP with OAuth 2.0 PKCE\n- OpenAPI-to-MCP codegen so you can turn other OpenAPI specs into MCP tools\n- I work at Taskade — submitting our own open-source server. Happy to answer review questions.\n\n### Example Code\n\n```bash\nnpx -y @taskade/mcp-server\n```\n\nHosted remote: https://www.taskade.com/mcp (OAuth 2.0 PKCE; 401 on unauthenticated initialize is expected)\n\n### Screenshots or Demo Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/taskade/mcp",
